</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">doOp</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">sub2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_functions.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_functions.test.function...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 1 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>函数<em>体</em>与函数<em>指针</em>有所区别。函数体的类型只能在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>使用，而函数<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Pointers/#Pointers\">指针</a>可以在运行时已知。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Pass-by-value-Parameters\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Pass-by-value-Parameters\">按值传递参数</a></h3>\n\n      <p><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a>和<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Floats/#Floats\">浮点数</a>等基本类型作为参数传递时会被复制，函数体中使用该副本。这称为“按值传递”。复制基本类型几乎没有成本，通常只需设置一个寄存器。</p>\n      <p>结构体、联合和数组有时通过引用传递更高效，因为复制成本可能随大小任意增长。将这些类型作为参数时，Zig 可以选择复制并按值传递，也可以按引用传递，取决于哪种方式更快。参数不可变这一性质，是允许这样实现的原因之一。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_pass_by_reference_or_value.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">,</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">,</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">};</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 此处 `point` 可以是引用，也可以是副本。函数体</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 可以忽略这一区别并将其视为值。获取参数地址时</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 必须非常谨慎：应将该地址视为在函数返回后</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#616972;--1:#99A0A6\">// 就会失效。</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"pass struct to function\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">Point</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">{ .</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, .</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> }));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_pass_by_reference_or_value.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_pass_by_reference_or_value.test.pass struct to function...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 1 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>对于 extern 函数，Zig 遵循 C ABI 按值传递结构体和联合。</p>\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Function-Parameter-Type-Inference\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Function-Parameter-Type-Inference\">函数参数类型推导</a></h3>\n\n      <p>声明函数参数时可以使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span></code> 代替类型。此时会在调用函数时推导参数类型。使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#TypeOf\">@TypeOf</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#typeInfo\">@typeInfo</a> 获取推导类型的信息。</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_fn_type_inference.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addFortyTwo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">anytype</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@TypeOf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"fn type inference\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">43</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addFortyTwo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">comptime_int</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@TypeOf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addFortyTwo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">44</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addFortyTwo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i64</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@TypeOf</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">addFortyTwo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_fn_type_inference.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_fn_type_inference.test.fn type inference...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 1 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n\n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"inline-fn\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#inline-fn\">inline fn</a></h3>\n\n      <p>在函数定义中添加 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 关键字，会使该函数在调用点进行<em>语义内联</em>。<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\">内联不是提示</a>，并非仅供优化阶段酌情采纳；它会影响函数调用中涉及的类型和值。</p>\n      <p>与普通函数调用不同，内联函数调用点中在编译时已知的实参会被视为<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#Compile-Time-Parameters\">编译时参数</a>。这种性质可能一直传播到返回值：</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">inline_call.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">pub</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">main</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1200</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">34</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1234</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">        </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@compileError</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"bad\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">    </span></span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">inline</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">i32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">debug</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">print</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"runtime a = {} b = {}\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, .{ </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">命令行</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig build-exe inline_call.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ ./inline_call</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">runtime a = 1200 b = 34</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>移除 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 后，测试将因编译错误而失败，而不是通过。</p>\n\n      <h4 id=\"Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Inline-Is-Not-A-Hint\">内联不是提示</a></h4>\n\n      <p>使用 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code> 会<em>限制</em>编译器可采取的处理方式。<strong>这可能损害二进制大小、编译速度，甚至运行时性能。</strong>作为交换，它能满足以下用例：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>为调试或与<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Assembly/#Assembly\">汇编</a>集成，确保调用栈中包含特定的栈帧。</li>\n        <li>如上例所示，强制将调用点恰好在<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">编译时</a>已知的参数信息传播到函数返回值。</li>\n        <li>绕过编译器后端实现的限制。</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>如果只想向编译器提示内联函数可能有益，应使用 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Builtin-Functions/#branchHint\">@branchHint</a>，而非 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span></code>。</p>\n      \n      \n\n      <h3 id=\"Function-Reflection\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Functions/#Function-Reflection\">函数反射</a></h3>\n\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_fn_reflection.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">math</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">math</span><sp